{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1507293-revenge-of-the-hellnun-a-jen\u2019s-redesign-thread","id":1507293,"title":"Revenge of the Hellnun: A Jen\u2019s Redesign Thread","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-04-03T09:02:26-07:00","id":1507293,"title":"Revenge of the Hellnun: A Jen\u2019s Redesign Thread","content":"<div align=\"center\"> <div class=\"img_align_center_wrapper\"><img width=\"2388\" height=\"1691\" data-align=\"center\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/481568210043273237/1087419225049661451/IMG_5385.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/481568210043273237/1087419225049661451/IMG_5385.jpg\" data-thumb-url=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/481568210043273237/1087419225049661451/IMG_5385.jpg\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment align_center js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/></div><br /> </div> <br /> <br /> <br /> I always have a soft spot for Sulumor, more infamously known as Hellnun, since she is just slaying it every pics despite that horrendous outfit that they gave her, so I thought of making her a new one for the new edition ~<br /> <br /> So I use Velificatio as the main set piece in the first design, basically it\u2019s a billowing veil used by Roman in arts to represent divinity which seem fitting for a green Zenith, and it looks like a warped halo to distinguish it from the perfectly circle halo of Creation\u2019s gods.<br /> <br /> The second one is more about her being bonded with an Agata when she exalted while still keeping the hellnun vibe, though I should probably add more wasp things on it since the wings alone doesn\u2019t scream wasp enough, it would be nice if Agate is butterfly instead since they are just straight up easier to create design off compare to wasp.<br /> <br /> And the last design is what she would wear if she\u2019s from a culture that dwell in a hot and dry climate, supposedly the Dune people are like, 99% naked according to the text so I have no idea how to make this design compatible with that fact\u2026","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":298,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","user":"Jen","date":". 04-03-2023, 12:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-03T12:27:58-07:00","id":1507306,"title":"","content":"Despite the limitations of character design for the sake of consistent illustrations, I would like to think that in the narrative Sulumor could easily have access to all of these and switch between them as desired. Especially if she wants to emphasize different Infernal qualities at different times; I like the Agata inspired one particularly on that count.<br /> <br /> Personally, I'd incline towards the first, if only because it kind of looks as though it could also function to shade her from the sun.<br /> <br /> Heh, just last night I was wondering to myself how to picture an outfit for an evil sorceress type that could be really tasteful and stylish without going for something like Elizabethan impracticality.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-07T11:01:52-07:00","id":1507700,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1507293-revenge-of-the-hellnun-a-jen\u2019s-redesign-thread?p=1507306#post1507306\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Despite the limitations of character design for the sake of consistent illustrations, I would like to think that in the narrative Sulumor could easily have access to all of these and switch between them as desired. Especially if she wants to emphasize different Infernal qualities at different times; I like the Agata inspired one particularly on that count.<br /> <br /> Personally, I'd incline towards the first, if only because it kind of looks as though it could also function to shade her from the sun.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh yeah, characters probably have multiple attires unless they are the poverty type, but it\u2019s nice to have an iconic one that can make the reader recognize you everywhere.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1507293-revenge-of-the-hellnun-a-jen\u2019s-redesign-thread?p=1507306#post1507306\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Heh, just last night I was wondering to myself how to picture an outfit for an evil sorceress type that could be really tasteful and stylish without going for something like Elizabethan impracticality.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fashion show where the theme is Elizabethan would probably have many examples since it does require the cloth being functional enough for you to walk while wearing them ~(o3o)~ Then you just need to spice up the design by adding more embroideries and jewelries ~","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-07T11:03:32-07:00","id":1507701,"title":"","content":"Also I\u2019m thinking about making a redesign sheet for the Lady in Bloodstained Something too, but it\u2019s hard to do so without knowing a good backstory for her, I don\u2019t even know if she should keep the whole thing about her being a sex worker and whether that should be reflected in her design.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-07T11:47:30-07:00","id":1507704,"title":"","content":"I would generally throw Scroll of Heroes out for anything that isn't the Alchemicals and Infernals, but that's just me. In particular, I recall that the Lady of Darkness's background being a result of an extended period of whinging from one Exalted freelancer to another (the author of the Abyssal characters in SoH) about the former's ex-girlfriend, so that's doubly cursed. Prior portrayals of the character, even earlier in 2e, don't even remotely line up with the monument to pettiness that made its way into the book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-08T07:20:18-07:00","id":1507766,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1507293-revenge-of-the-hellnun-a-jen\u2019s-redesign-thread?p=1507701#post1507701\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also I\u2019m thinking about making a redesign sheet for the Lady in Bloodstained Something too, but it\u2019s hard to do so without knowing a good backstory for her, I don\u2019t even know if she should keep the whole thing about her being a sex worker and whether that should be reflected in her design.</div> </div> </div> </div>I personally kept the former sex worker aspect for using her as an NPC because I saw it as an opportunity to humanise rather than dehumanise her like what Scroll of Heroes did. I'd describe the aesthetic that she has in my head as &quot;an ancient Minoan woman whose recently discovered the goth subculture&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-10T13:05:44-07:00","id":1507954,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1507293-revenge-of-the-hellnun-a-jen\u2019s-redesign-thread?p=1507704#post1507704\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would generally throw Scroll of Heroes out for anything that isn't the Alchemicals and Infernals, but that's just me. In particular, I recall that the Lady of Darkness's background being a result of an extended period of whinging from one Exalted freelancer to another (the author of the Abyssal characters in SoH) about the former's ex-girlfriend, so that's doubly cursed. Prior portrayals of the character, even earlier in 2e, don't even remotely line up with the monument to pettiness that made its way into the book.</div> </div> </div> </div>Who know that the Infernal sigs of all people would have the better writing in SoH.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1507293-revenge-of-the-hellnun-a-jen\u2019s-redesign-thread?p=1507766#post1507766\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I personally kept the former sex worker aspect for using her as an NPC because I saw it as an opportunity to humanise rather than dehumanise her like what Scroll of Heroes did. I'd describe the aesthetic that she has in my head as &quot;an ancient Minoan woman whose recently discovered the goth subculture&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah yeah, it would be quite cool to think of a design where she\u2019s still shirtless but isn\u2019t as wack as her old design, and Minoan would work quite nice as a reference ~","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":298,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","user":"Jen","date":". 04-10-2023, 04:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-10T14:12:41-07:00","id":1507957,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1507293-revenge-of-the-hellnun-a-jen\u2019s-redesign-thread?p=1507954#post1507954\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Who know that the Infernal sigs of all people would have the better writing in SoH.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's kind of subjective. They don't have writeups anywhere else to compare to, and the author screws up every instance of spelling &quot;coadjutor&quot;, and Bitter Copal's story has personal details of key characters shifting in the middle, but they lack the buildup to disappointment for most of the Abyssals (only to get Oops All Skeletors! after 7 years), and they don't have Caste book writeups from the prior edition to outshine them, as in the case of the Solars.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-11T07:44:56-07:00","id":1508032,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1507293-revenge-of-the-hellnun-a-jen\u2019s-redesign-thread?p=1507954#post1507954\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ah yeah, it would be quite cool to think of a design where she\u2019s still shirtless but isn\u2019t as wack as her old design, and Minoan would work quite nice as a reference ~</div> </div> </div> </div>Happy to help.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1507293-revenge-of-the-hellnun-a-jen\u2019s-redesign-thread?p=1507704#post1507704\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I recall that the Lady of Darkness's background being a result of an extended period of whinging from one Exalted freelancer to another (the author of the Abyssal characters in SoH) about the former's ex-girlfriend, so that's doubly cursed. Prior portrayals of the character, even earlier in 2e, don't even remotely line up with the monument to pettiness that made its way into the book.</div> </div> </div> </div>So, there was confirmation on the Discord that these comments intended as a joke that the fandom played a game of telephone with.\u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-11T09:06:16-07:00","id":1508041,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1507293-revenge-of-the-hellnun-a-jen\u2019s-redesign-thread?p=1508032#post1508032\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So, there was confirmation on the Discord that these comments intended as a joke that the fandom played a game of telephone with.\u200b</div> </div> </div> </div>So I'll just trim things back to saying that it was a really bad idea, whatever the origin, and that the SoH writeup is still not in keeping with the portrayal all the way back in Exalted: Abyssals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-11T09:58:48-07:00","id":1508046,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1507293-revenge-of-the-hellnun-a-jen\u2019s-redesign-thread?p=1508041#post1508041\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So I'll just trim things back to saying that it was a really bad idea, whatever the origin, and that the SoH writeup is still not in keeping with the portrayal all the way back in Exalted: Abyssals.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh yeah, I think in some ways it's even worse because that story gives us a clear cut villain when it's more likely a writer who thought he was giving the fanbase what they wanted by making fun of chaintits.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-23T06:54:38-07:00","id":1509371,"title":"","content":"Cool, I like the first two designs best for whatever reason. The wings and velificatio are both pretty. I like all of the necklace pendants you gave her. What's the inspiration for the bottom pendant in design #3?<br /> <br /> I imagine Sulumor does sometimes go almost-nude in Malfeas, where she doesn't have to worry about the Unconquered Sun burning her, but she would always wear some fancy stuff because of her station. In Creation she'd wear all-covering robes because she doesn't spend all day underground anymore. But I imagine her going barefoot on the sand because it reminds her of being naked.<br /> <br /> Obviously, the books probably shouldn't depict her as naked very often! Although the Dune Person in Compass: Wyld is not sexualized and has the sensitive bits covered up by her limbs.<br /> <br /> For <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1837-show-us-your-commissions-2-the-revenge?p=1505440#post1505440\">my</a> Sulumor redesign I gave her simple humble-looking robes because she was described that way. But of course I can't draw anything like as good as Jen can!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-25T00:59:09-07:00","id":1509563,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1507293-revenge-of-the-hellnun-a-jen\u2019s-redesign-thread#post1507293\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><div align=\"center\"> <div class=\"img_align_center_wrapper\"><img width=\"2388\" height=\"1691\" data-align=\"center\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/481568210043273237/1087419225049661451/IMG_5385.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/481568210043273237/1087419225049661451/IMG_5385.jpg\" data-thumb-url=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/481568210043273237/1087419225049661451/IMG_5385.jpg\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment align_center js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/></div><br /> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> I always have a soft spot for Sulumor, more infamously known as Hellnun, since she is just slaying it every pics despite that horrendous outfit that they gave her, so I thought of making her a new one for the new edition ~<br /> <br /> So I use Velificatio as the main set piece in the first design, basically it\u2019s a billowing veil used by Roman in arts to represent divinity which seem fitting for a green Zenith, and it looks like a warped halo to distinguish it from the perfectly circle halo of Creation\u2019s gods.<br /> <br /> The second one is more about her being bonded with an Agata when she exalted while still keeping the hellnun vibe, though I should probably add more wasp things on it since the wings alone doesn\u2019t scream wasp enough, it would be nice if Agate is butterfly instead since they are just straight up easier to create design off compare to wasp.<br /> <br /> And the last design is what she would wear if she\u2019s from a culture that dwell in a hot and dry climate, supposedly the Dune people are like, 99% naked according to the text so I have no idea how to make this design compatible with that fact\u2026</div> </div> </div> </div>I like the middle pic with the hat best because it makes me think about Locust Mana Plague potentially being her cult's major selling point to people who aren't familiar with the gods or the Yozis but are really quite hungry, and her outfit being like the Exalted equivalent of those used car company mascots. &quot;Stick with me, and you'll never go hungry again!&quot;<br /> ...<br /> ...great, now I'm imagining Sulumor as The Monarch from Venture Bros, but for locusts instead of butterflies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26460-organ-boy","name":"Organ Boy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-25T03:09:57-07:00","id":1509569,"title":"","content":"I considered the nun habit-parody outfit to be a nod to her pre-Exaltation faith and a deliberate mockery. Sexy Nun as a deliberate blasphemy to the spirits who abandoned her. Even if it isn't entirely compatible with the canonical depictions of the Dune people. Given the Manual of Power: Infernals book is not compatible with itself, I do not consider a major issue. Whether or not or tribe wore more clothes, or if was a requirement of religious station, (though I do lean towards the latter) didn't matter much at the time. Heck, on her <a href=\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Characters/ExaltedExalted\" target=\"_blank\">TvTropes page</a>, calls out that nobody dresses like that in Creation.<br /> <br /> With a new edition, a bigger Creation and stepping away from the parody, I'd favour the third outfit. It is more hijab than habit, but as both carry religious associations the change is minimal.I'd lean more on to the idea it is representive of what her place in among her people should have been but even greater. They cast her out, and then their parents picked her up and made her their Champion. Hence the fancy bracers/bracelets and the head jewllery. Saint Sulumor has returned and she does not care for either of the spirits or shaman her practically exiled her<br /> The dreamcatcher amulet is a great touch. The idea of taking the trappings meant to honour the gods to in fact pay homeage their enemies carries that heretical element forward, even if it is more subtle. To be honest I hope 3e Infernals are less...not subtle and more consistent in their book, but that is outside the scope of this thread. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-25T08:42:35-07:00","id":1509588,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Erinys</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1507293-revenge-of-the-hellnun-a-jen\u2019s-redesign-thread?p=1509371#post1509371\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Cool, I like the first two designs best for whatever reason. The wings and velificatio are both pretty. I like all of the necklace pendants you gave her. What's the inspiration for the bottom pendant in design #3?</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah I used the Tuareg as reference for her jewelries.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://www.amazigh.it/wp-content/uploads/2019/12/s-l1600-96.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://www.amazigh.it/wp-content/uploads/2019/12/s-l1600-96.jpg\" data-thumb-url=\"https://www.amazigh.it/wp-content/uploads/2019/12/s-l1600-96.jpg\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Erinys</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1507293-revenge-of-the-hellnun-a-jen\u2019s-redesign-thread?p=1509371#post1509371\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1837-show-us-your-commissions-2-the-revenge?p=1505440#post1505440\">my</a> Sulumor redesign I gave her simple humble-looking robes because she was described that way. But of course I can't draw anything like as good as Jen can!</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b<br /> She always posing in the Infernal book like she's on a Vogue magazine tryout so I can't help but see her as really really into fashion even though her people rarely wear anything.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Organ Boy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1507293-revenge-of-the-hellnun-a-jen\u2019s-redesign-thread?p=1509563#post1509563\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I like the middle pic with the hat best because it makes me think about Locust Mana Plague potentially being her cult's major selling point to people who aren't familiar with the gods or the Yozis but are really quite hungry, and her outfit being like the Exalted equivalent of those used car company mascots. &quot;Stick with me, and you'll never go hungry again!&quot;<br /> ...<br /> ...great, now I'm imagining Sulumor as The Monarch from Venture Bros, but for locusts instead of butterflies.</div> </div> </div> </div>I wonder if making her veil into an actual (transformed) Agata so that the wings can move like an actual wasp would be a good or bad addition to her getup...Kinda like how catgirl can get very expressive with their ears.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1507293-revenge-of-the-hellnun-a-jen\u2019s-redesign-thread?p=1509569#post1509569\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The dreamcatcher amulet is a great touch. The idea of taking the trappings meant to honour the gods to in fact pay homeage their enemies carries that heretical element forward, even if it is more subtle. To be honest I hope 3e Infernals are less...not subtle and more consistent in their book, but that is outside the scope of this thread.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah that's just a fancy pendant, but she does keep her veil closed with a Ligier pin based on the Qajar's Sun motif though<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fb/Shirkhorshid.JPG\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fb/Shirkhorshid.JPG\" data-thumb-url=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fb/Shirkhorshid.JPG\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/><br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-25T17:10:45-07:00","id":1509647,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1507293-revenge-of-the-hellnun-a-jen\u2019s-redesign-thread?p=1509588#post1509588\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder if making her veil into an actual (transformed) Agata so that the wings can move like an actual wasp would be a good or bad addition to her getup...Kinda like how catgirl can get very expressive with their ears.</div> </div> </div> </div>I still have a strong mental image of Infernal Exalted attired in a way informed by Kill la Kill.<br /> <br /> I could think of it in terms of being a small version of how the Yozis themselves feature landscapes that are themselves composed of demons, or else their own features are geography and geology with the properties of writhing flesh. I think it would be fitting for some Green Sun Prince to literally wear a demon or ten.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-30T13:01:02-07:00","id":1510239,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1507293-revenge-of-the-hellnun-a-jen\u2019s-redesign-thread?p=1509647#post1509647\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I still have a strong mental image of Infernal Exalted attired in a way informed by Kill la Kill.<br /> <br /> I could think of it in terms of being a small version of how the Yozis themselves feature landscapes that are themselves composed of demons, or else their own features are geography and geology with the properties of writhing flesh. I think it would be fitting for some Green Sun Prince to literally wear a demon or ten.</div> </div> </div> </div>The existence of the living armor, plus the art of demon in GoD does point at organic and fleshy being quite a popular aesthetic in Hell, though it seems that Ex3 hasn\u2019t incorporated that aspect in demon Illustration yet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-02T19:04:19-07:00","id":1510541,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1507293-revenge-of-the-hellnun-a-jen\u2019s-redesign-thread?p=1509588#post1509588\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ah I used the Tuareg as reference for her jewelries.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://www.amazigh.it/wp-content/uploads/2019/12/s-l1600-96.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://www.amazigh.it/wp-content/uploads/2019/12/s-l1600-96.jpg\" data-thumb-url=\"https://www.amazigh.it/wp-content/uploads/2019/12/s-l1600-96.jpg\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> \u200b<br /> She always posing in the Infernal book like she's on a Vogue magazine tryout so I can't help but see her as really really into fashion even though her people rarely wear anything.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> I wonder if making her veil into an actual (transformed) Agata so that the wings can move like an actual wasp would be a good or bad addition to her getup...Kinda like how catgirl can get very expressive with their ears.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Ah that's just a fancy pendant, but she does keep her veil closed with a Ligier pin based on the Qajar's Sun motif though<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fb/Shirkhorshid.JPG\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fb/Shirkhorshid.JPG\" data-thumb-url=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fb/Shirkhorshid.JPG\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/><br /> </div></div> </div> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, I'd <i>definitely </i>second the transformed Agata thing. The most fun thing about Infernal artifacts is how alive they are.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26460-organ-boy","name":"Organ Boy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}